Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Every integrity function your operators need, on one tablet,\Nwith no server and no connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.22,0:00:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Start on the dashboard. Key indicators, a heatmap of every\Nmonitoring point, and symbols that tell you what the equipment\Nis at a glance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.10,0:00:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Open a point. The pictogram says what it is, the state says how\Nbad it is, and the trend shows where it is going.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.06,0:00:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Register assets against ISO 14224. The category carries its\Nsymbol, and the risk band drives the inspection interval.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.57,0:00:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Relief valves keep their own registry, with sizing and overdue\Ntests flagged in red before anyone has to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.58,0:01:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A pipeline is not an icon. It is a kilometres bar: severity per\Nsegment, every asset placed by station, findings where they\Nhappened.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.52,0:01:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Inject the field round as a CSV. Columns are mapped\Nautomatically, every row is validated, and the bad one is\Nrejected with a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.14,0:01:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Run the rules and the app turns readings into ranked\Nrecommendations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.24,0:01:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then generate the dossier on the device, ready to print, sign\Nand hand over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.48,0:01:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Field data. Field decisions. No signal required.
